2.Click LOVs and click on wizard
		New Record Group Based on a query
		SELECT DEPTNO FROM EMP
		Move DEPTNO in LOV Columns
		Return Value> Look up return item> EMP.DEPTNO
		Title: LOV FOR DEPTNO
		move EMP.DEPTNO to Assigned Items
		<Finish>
		<SAVE AND COMPILE>
